{
  "_comment": [
    "Cara 1 (disarankan): hook command + async.",
    "Gabungkan blok 'hooks' ini ke ~/.claude/settings.json kamu.",
    "Ganti /ABSOLUTE/PATH/KE jadi lokasi office-report.mjs yang sebenarnya.",
    "",
    "Kenapa async: true — hook ini jalan di latar belakang dan nggak nahan tool",
    "call sama sekali. Tanpa itu, tiap Read/Edit/Bash nunggu respons ERPNext",
    "dulu (lewat Cloudflare bisa 200-400 ms), dan Claude Code jadi kerasa berat.",
    "",
    "SessionEnd punya anggaran total cuma 1.5 detik untuk semua hook-nya, jadi",
    "async di situ bukan optimasi — itu syarat.",
    "",
    "Kredensial JANGAN ditaruh di sini. Simpan di ~/.xsha-office.json",
    "(chmod 600) atau sebagai env var. File settings.json gampang ke-commit."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node /ABSOLUTE/PATH/KE/office-report.mjs",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node /ABSOLUTE/PATH/KE/office-report.mjs",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node /ABSOLUTE/PATH/KE/office-report.mjs",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node /ABSOLUTE/PATH/KE/office-report.mjs",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUseFailure": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node /ABSOLUTE/PATH/KE/office-report.mjs",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PermissionRequest": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node /ABSOLUTE/PATH/KE/office-report.mjs",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PermissionDenied": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node /ABSOLUTE/PATH/KE/office-report.mjs",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node /ABSOLUTE/PATH/KE/office-report.mjs",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "StopFailure": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node /ABSOLUTE/PATH/KE/office-report.mjs",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node /ABSOLUTE/PATH/KE/office-report.mjs",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
